; Bob leaks, then Alice pays. The whole trace is a trace of "bob MUST_NOT leak
; THEN alice MUST pay" with the outcome DONE, but its prefix up to the leak,
; entry 1, is a violated trace, and no shorter prefix has an outcome: the status
; is VIOLATED at entry 1, and it stays so (formal/core/CORE.md, decision 34).
; "alice MUST pay THEN bob MUST_NOT leak" is executed only when Alice pays, at
; entry 2, after the leak, so its status is DONE.
(scenario sequence_violation_then_done
  (spec "examples/core/core_sequence.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T09:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T10:00:00Z" (act bob leak must_not)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T11:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data)))
